# Logical, side-major view of a Juku 5.25-inch DSDD CP/M data disk: 80
# cylinders, two sides, ten 512-byte sectors per side.  Juku's BIOS reserves
# two logical tracks and uses 197 4K blocks; the final half-block is the
# historical unallocated "phantom boundary".  build_doom_library.py converts
# this view to the cylinder-interleaved raw layout used by jukuhost and disks.
diskdef juku-logical
  seclen 512
  tracks 160
  sectrk 10
  blocksize 4096
  maxdir 128
  skewtab 0,2,4,6,8,1,3,5,7,9
  boottrk 2
  os 2.2
end
